35,2,1,talk,Minako,,The fixed costs are high. Over 280k yen before fuel.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, that’s a lot. And the other groups failed on favours.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"@Minako, the car is often dirty or low on fuel.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shion,,"@Minako, the fuel receipts show two people did most of the driving.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shion, that’s unfair. The diary shows uneven days too.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, so an even split is wrong?","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, yes. We need to account for usage.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Daisuke, the weekly trips are the problem. They collapse.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, if we book in advance, that stops it.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shion, but the mechanic said short runs hurt the car.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Minako,,"@Daisuke, that’s a good point. Short runs cost more.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, so we need a system that handles that.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Benjamin, a booking calendar might work.","{""words"":6,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, or a fixed day allocation.","{""words"":6,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shion, I’m worried about the time it takes to manage.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Minako,,Let’s vote. We have three options.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,Option A: Fixed days. Option B: Booking. Option C: Primary keeper.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Asuka,,I prefer B. It’s fair and clear.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shion,,I prefer A. It’s simple.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think B is less stressful.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
